WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.665 --> 00:00:03.415
(jubilant music)

00:00:04.522 --> 00:00:07.129
(cars rev loudly)

00:00:07.129 --> 00:00:08.064
- [Hamda] Between me and my sister,

00:00:08.064 --> 00:00:09.815
there's a lot of competition.

00:00:09.815 --> 00:00:11.802
- It's a race, everybody wants to win,

00:00:11.802 --> 00:00:14.438
but off-track, we're just like
any other normal teenager.

00:00:14.438 --> 00:00:17.151
We hang out with our
family, with our friends.

00:00:17.151 --> 00:00:19.916
But, in racing, it's
where we feel most alive.

00:00:19.916 --> 00:00:23.333
(robust energetic music)

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.711
- My name is Amna Al
Qubaisi, I'm 17 years old.

00:00:37.711 --> 00:00:41.040
- And my name is Hamda Al
Qubaisi and I'm 15 years old.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.974
- [Amna] And we are the
first Emirati female drivers.

00:00:43.974 --> 00:00:46.187
- What I love most about racing is,

00:00:46.187 --> 00:00:48.103
you can always do better and better.

00:00:48.103 --> 00:00:50.108
It's the best feeling
when you feel the speed

00:00:50.108 --> 00:00:53.160
and you can improve so
fast, just by focusing.

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:56.906
(pulsing inspirational music)

00:00:56.906 --> 00:00:59.212
- I first became interested
in go-karting when I saw

00:00:59.212 --> 00:01:02.489
my dad racing inside
and outside of the UAE.

00:01:02.489 --> 00:01:05.294
All he ever talked about
was racing and meeting

00:01:05.294 --> 00:01:06.832
different drivers around the world,

00:01:06.832 --> 00:01:08.373
and going to different tracks.

00:01:08.373 --> 00:01:10.372
He's always there to help me calm down,

00:01:10.372 --> 00:01:13.400
and he plays a really big
role in my recent career.

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:15.941
(pulsing inspirational music)

00:01:15.941 --> 00:01:18.371
- I have been racing
professionally since 2009.

00:01:18.371 --> 00:01:21.323
I first noticed the talent
in my daughter, Amna,

00:01:21.323 --> 00:01:22.779
when she was three years old.

00:01:22.779 --> 00:01:24.715
She saw a quad and she wanted to drive it,

00:01:24.715 --> 00:01:26.802
and before even giving
her any instructions,

00:01:26.802 --> 00:01:27.800
she knew where the throttle is,

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:29.233
where the brakes are.

00:01:29.233 --> 00:01:31.304
So, I immediately know
that she had the touch.

00:01:31.304 --> 00:01:34.389
Hamda, her sister, she wanted
to also to get into racing.

00:01:34.389 --> 00:01:36.926
And she surprised us all
because in her first season,

00:01:36.926 --> 00:01:38.402
she was able to win races.

00:01:38.402 --> 00:01:42.235
(pulsing inspirational music)

00:01:44.125 --> 00:01:47.824
- So far, I have 16
trophies and three wins.

00:01:47.824 --> 00:01:51.310
- I've won over 20 trophies,
including four wins,

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:53.335
and still counting.

00:01:53.335 --> 00:01:57.088
My mom, she helps me, she
takes me to the tracks,

00:01:57.088 --> 00:01:58.724
she takes me around the world.

00:01:58.724 --> 00:02:01.029
- Yeah, she's the best. (laughs)

00:02:01.029 --> 00:02:04.692
- Both of them are always
competing, which make it

00:02:04.692 --> 00:02:07.122
very interesting for us, as a family.

00:02:07.122 --> 00:02:10.262
It's very interesting to see
them racing against boys.

00:02:10.262 --> 00:02:12.956
It show how girls can race against a boy,

00:02:12.956 --> 00:02:14.700
and can win a race.

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:17.533
(cars rev loudly)

00:02:22.154 --> 00:02:24.395
- Being the first Emirati to win the

00:02:24.395 --> 00:02:27.825
UAE RMC championship is pretty big.

00:02:27.825 --> 00:02:30.660
There's no female Emirati
that's done it before.

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:32.740
It was a big achievement.

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:36.106
(cars rev loudly)

00:02:36.106 --> 00:02:38.167
- I believe my daughters
are breaking barriers

00:02:38.167 --> 00:02:39.554
for women, in general.

00:02:39.554 --> 00:02:42.203
And our women, in particular.

00:02:42.203 --> 00:02:43.769
We're happy to see that
people's perception

00:02:43.769 --> 00:02:46.133
are being changing about
our region and culture,

00:02:46.133 --> 00:02:48.002
and about women, in general.

00:02:48.002 --> 00:02:52.169
And I believe that this
is great for motor sports.

